 "ez_index": 327,
 "name": "ST65EV_EVENT00.BBQ",
 "strings": [
  "",
  "Meanwhile...",
  "On Earth, the fighting went on too.",
  "Axis's return to the Earth Sphere",
  "and the indiscriminate attacks",
  "begun by the Gryps 2 colony laser",
  "brought great changes",
  "on the ground as well.",
  "Karaba, and",
  "the Federation units siding with it,",
  "alarmed by the military regime",
  "the Titans were leading,",
  "mustered forces and struck back.",
  "The Federation Forces of the day",
  "were, after all, fence-sitters,",
  "mocked as a make-work agency.",
  "They sensed that if the Titans",
  "took power, they themselves",
  "would be purged,",
  "and the AEUG had a reputation",
  "for paying its people",
  "in full and on time.",
  "They were, in effect, little more",
  "than a huge band of mercenaries.",
  "Karaba played on this skillfully.",
  "If the Titans, those butchers,",
  "were defeated,",
  "anyone who had sided with them",
  "would carry that stigma",
  "forever.",
  "If the Titans won,",
  "ordinary Federation troops would",
  "be out in the cold forever...!",
  "The propaganda worked.",
  "Protect the lives of space citizens",
  "but keep the Federation intact.",
  "To people worn out",
  "by clashes of radical ideologies,",
  "that had an appealing ring,",
  "and it was well received.",
  "Then came the winter of 0088.",
  "To seize North America,",
  "laid waste by the colony drop,",
  "in a single stroke,",
  "Karaba's ground forces joined",
  "with Zeon remnants to launch",
  "a large-scale military operation.",
  "The objectives were",
  "the One Year War's",
  "greatest production base,",
  "California,",
  "and",
  "the Oakland NT Research Institute.",
  "Oakland NT Research Institute",
  "Enter the SFS",
  "The Oakland NT Research Institute,",
  "also called the Augusta Institute,",
  "was a venerable institution",
  "built on the Federation Forces'",
  "new weapons research agency.",
  "Oakland's staff are thought",
  "to have had their eye",
  "on Newtypes early on,",
  "probably even",
  "before the war.",
  "They kept up their research",
  "in a North America almost",
  "entirely occupied by Zeon,",
  "which shows",
  "astonishing nerve.",
  "Or perhaps",
  "they may have had",
  "some link or other",
  "with Matilda Ajan,",
  "General Revil and other",
  "Newtype advocates",
  "inside the Federation.",
  "Indeed, that is borne out",
  "by the fact that the Gundam NT-1",
  "was developed under",
  "the Augusta Institute's lead.",
  "It was a new model with",
  "nothing more than",
  "magnetic coating",
  "applied, but",
  "that a single lab had created it",
  "with exceptional performance",
  "is shown by how it later",
  "became the GM Custom and",
  "the GM Quel, both",
  "mass-produced.",
  "It had not been given",
  "an official production number,",
  "but with the peerless genius",
  "Tem Ray now gone,",
  "Oakland was regarded",
  "as one of the Federation's finest",
  "teams of military engineers.",
  "Indeed, the ORX-005 Gaplant",
  "and the other",
  "Augusta prototype MS,",
  "along with their Cyber-Newtypes,",
  "had become a threat to the AEUG.",
  "And so",
  "the fact that they had sided",
  "with the Titans",
  "was seen as",
  "dangerous in the extreme.",
  "For the outnumbered AEUG",
  "to keep beating the Titans,",
  "technical superiority",
  "was the only way.",
  "Such was the judgment.",
  "Just as the Federation in space",
  "was dismayed by its vastness,",
  "the Zeon forces on Earth",
  "were dismayed by its vastness too.",
  "Distances like",
  "50 or 100 kilometers,",
  "no more than",
  "a snail's crawl in space,",
  "were, on Earth,",
  "simply too far.",
  "In space, mobile suits had",
  "unmatched mobility, but",
  "on the ground they were little",
  "different from armored vehicles.",
  "Had nothing changed, the MS",
  "would probably have lost",
  "its value as a ground weapon",
  "and been replaced",
  "by tanks, mobile tanks,",
  "mobile vehicles and other",
  "large-scale weapons.",
  "But when Amuro fired his verniers",
  "and fought Dopps",
  "in the air,",
  "it changed everything.",
  "The machine had never",
  "been designed",
  "for anything like that.",
  "As for Amuro himself,",
  "he surely did it only",
  "to protect White Base,",
  "in sheer desperation.",
  "But it led",
  "to the idea of making",
  "mobile suits take to the air.",
  "They need not truly fly;",
  "the aim was fast, long-range",
  "movement using verniers.",
  "At first, it was thought",
  "that boosting backpack thrust",
  "would achieve this,",
  "and it met with some success.",
  "This direction was pursued",
  "in the GP Project, among others.",
  "But it did not work out.",
  "The reason was",
  "that there was a limit to the",
  "propellant a machine could carry.",
  "The more thrust was increased,",
  "the more propellant it needed,",
  "and the weight of that propellant",
  "cut the machine's mobility.",
  "And enlarging the machine",
  "to make up for that",
  "only demanded more thrust...",
  "To escape this vicious circle,",
  "people turned to the Dodai YS.",
  "Originally",
  "a large Zeon flying-wing bomber,",
  "it had, through a design error,",
  "ended up with surplus thrust",
  "and a payload big enough",
  "to fly with a mobile suit",
  "on its back.",
  "As a bomber,",
  "it was as flawed as they come,",
  "but the Dodai",
  "caught the European Front's eye,",
  "and was put to real use",
  "carrying mobile suits",
  "in airborne operations.",
  "Or perhaps it had been",
  "the idea of Ginias Sahalin,",
  "who kept a Dodai II",
  "modified for transport",
  "on his own initiative,",
  "or of his friend",
  "Yuri Kellerne.",
  "After the Delaz Conflict,",
  "the Federation Forces took notice.",
  "The plan was to pair",
  "Hizacks with Dodais",
  "and smoothly deliver units",
  "wherever they were needed.",
  "That way, no extra propellant",
  "would weigh the machine down,",
  "and air assaults became possible.",
  "The Dodai itself could serve",
  "as a transport or recon plane,",
  "and unmanned, it became a missile.",
  "Unlike earlier gear",
  "such as the",
  "Sturm Booster,",
  "it was not entirely",
  "disposable.",
  "Best of all,",
  "it was far less trouble",
  "to operate than",
  "transformable mobile suits.",
  "Parts were easy to share,",
  "and VTOL transports were old hat,",
  "pre-One Year War technology.",
  "It could readily be adapted",
  "for civilian use,",
  "so demand was assured.",
  "Even Vinson Plan ships",
  "and conventional aircraft carriers",
  "could operate it.",
  "It had everything going for it.",
  "The trouble was",
  "transformable mobile suits,",
  "far superior in mobility;",
  "against these alone",
  "it was at a disadvantage.",
  "It is fair to say that",
  "transformable MS, rather than",
  "pursue their original aim,",
  "flexible deployment,",
  "ended up specializing",
  "in destroying",
  "the enemy's transformable MS.",
  "In the years that followed,",
  "until flight systems based on",
  "Minovsky physics were miniaturized",
  "and became widespread--",
  "for nearly 60 years--",
  "the sky",
  "belonged to the Dodai",
  "and its children."
 ]
}
